  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/02YV">Lemma <span data-tag="02YV">65.12.2</span>.</a> Let $S \in \mathop{\mathrm{Ob}}\nolimits (\mathit{Sch}_{fppf})$ be a scheme. A composition of (closed, resp. open) immersions of algebraic spaces over $S$ is a (closed, resp. open) immersion of algebraic spaces over $S$. </p>
